{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"santizhu059-e-sr-psz-two-palaces-verdict","title":"裴松之论孙权立和宠霸之失并斥步骘附霸","accounts":[{"id":"santizhu059-a-450d609012f03047b1a6","label":"裴松之按语","text":"臣松之以为权既立和复宠霸坐生乱阶自构家祸，方之袁刘昏悖甚矣；步骘以德度著称而阿附于霸事同杨竺，吕岱全琮之徒不足论","evidence":["santizhu059-q-5aaa98a917c5bcdf8af6"]}],"participants":[{"person":"shaodi-p0003","role":"评论二宫之祸与步骘附霸","evidence":["santizhu059-q-5aaa98a917c5bcdf8af6"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"未由相邻段落推算纪年；原文时间表达保留在来源引句中。","evidence":["santizhu059-q-5aaa98a917c5bcdf8af6"]},"ordering_evidence":"santizhu059-q-5aaa98a917c5bcdf8af6","source_order":[59,184,0],"order":10461}],"persons":[{"id":"shaodi-p0003","name":"裴松之","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"santizhu059-q-5aaa98a917c5bcdf8af6","section":"chapter-059","block":"b-5f46f44a6afd45a034dd","layer":"pei","quote":"臣松之以为：袁绍、刘表谓尚、琮为贤，本有传后之意；异于孙权既以立和而复宠霸，坐生乱阶，自构家祸：方之袁、刘，昏悖甚矣！步骘以德度著称，为吴良臣，而阿附于霸，事同杨竺，何哉？","attribution":"裴松之按语","section_title":"吴主五子传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0125.xhtml","index":183,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-dd8f362aa12f2b2ad583","start":0,"end":86,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
